@AzureSuite.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7291

### Paste a fresh token here (never commit a real value - get one via:
### az account get-access-token --resource api://edd37b21-2fdb-401b-992b-96723111682a --query accessToken -o tsv
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### List messages
GET {{AzureSuite.Api_HostAddress}}/api/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a message
POST {{AzureSuite.Api_HostAddress}}/api/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messageId": "MSG-0002",
  "endToEndId": "E2E-0002",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "debtorName": "Alice",
  "debtorIban": "DE89370400440532013000",
  "debtorBic": "COBADEFFXXX",
  "creditorName": "Bob",
  "creditorIban": "FR1420041010050500013M02606",
  "creditorBic": "PSSTFRPPXXX",
  "remittanceInformation": "Invoice 42"
}

### No token - should return 401
GET {{AzureSuite.Api_HostAddress}}/api/messages
Accept: application/json
